    "rationale": "The current layout has vertical congestion around y=26–31 with overlapping fanin paths (e.g., edge [4,10] detour=10, [10,12] detour=2). Moving nodes 10,11,12 down by 2 tiles aligns them with the vacancy hotspot at y=24–26 (window_21_27_23_29), reducing Manhattan detours. Nodes 13,15,16 shift down by 2 to preserve fanout geometry to output 3 while exploiting empty band at x=25–27, y=30–32 (window_21_27_31_37). This contracts height from 18→16 tiles (y_min=20, y_max=35) without moving ports, preserving PI/PO envelope width=9; area reduces from 162→144 tiles. All moves respect neighbor anchors and avoid collisions."
